                "OrderPreserving encryption on unbounded STRING field '" + fieldName
                        + "' is not supported; use FieldType.string(maxLength) for bounded string");
        case BOOLEAN, FLOAT16, FLOAT32, FLOAT64 -> throw new IllegalArgumentException(
